    "identifier": "fushin-typhoon-release-vacuum-collapse",
    "description": "<p>You coat your hand in wind chakra before releasing it as a disrupting pulse. Make a melee ninjutsu (or taijutsu) attack, dealing 4d10 wind damage against the target creature on a hit the target. On a hit, the target makes a Constitution saving throw, becoming Weakened on a failed save as the air is forced out of their lungs.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creatures is able to resist this jutsu’s effects.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures gain 1 rank of Weakened until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures gain 1 rank of Weakened.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Affected creatures gain 2 ranks of Weakened.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the ranks of weakened gained by +1.</p>",
